# HC-018 合成イベントパケット

SYNTHETIC_TRAINING_ONLY

これは有限の教材用パケットであり、VS Codeのイベントスキーマ、実際のログ、実際のsandboxの観察結果ではありません。各ケースのイベントの形と欠測だけを使い、パケットが示す範囲を超えて原因を断定しないでください。

```json
{"caseId":"packet-01","selected":false,"events":[]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-02","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"pending"}]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-03","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"deny","actor":"human"}]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-04","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"allow-once"},{"type":"execution"},{"type":"result","layer":"os","code":"EACCES","exitCode":1}]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-05","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"allow-once"},{"type":"execution"},{"type":"result","layer":"program","output":"v22.16.0\n","exitCode":0}]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-06","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"allow-once"},{"type":"execution"},{"type":"result","layer":"program","code":"SYNTHETIC_PROGRAM_ERROR","exitCode":2}]}
```

```json
{"caseId":"packet-07","selected":true,"events":[{"type":"proposal","command":"node --version"},{"type":"approval","decision":"allow-once"},{"type":"execution"},{"type":"result","layer":"unknown","code":"INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE","exitCode":null}]}
```

`v22.16.0` はパケット内の合成文字列です。手元のNode.jsのバージョンではありません。packet-07の `null` を0や0以外の値に置き換えません。
